    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor grill for high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground beef, Worcestershire sauce, liquid smoke, and garlic powder in a medium bowl; lightly mix until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0RwR6cz9RcpDlayDHLb9mHj-AhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87586-Delicious-Grilled-Hamburgers-ddmfs-Step2-4x3-RM-1475-501f89d526994012a293f19aaa1797c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87586/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "With minimal handling, form mixture into three patties.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3A1vlRU8kXnX168EmZ84OvIwAkg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87586-Delicious-Grilled-Hamburgers-ddmfs-Step3-4x3-RM-1480-13a4165b3dc44f6d85c7aefe9c51b305.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87586/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush oil onto both sides of each patty, then season with salt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4i8Xmo60jF0-aKvNGIEs8J6UGRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87586-Delicious-Grilled-Hamburgers-ddmfs-Step4-4x3-RM-1482-b14395f9f59c4684bd4a9a04f8ddbba8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87586/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook patties on the preheated grill until no longer pink in the center, about 5 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 160 degrees F (70 degrees C).",
